subject: fix(ux): replace silent console.log catches with user-visible toasts in ModelsCard (GAP-P2-29)

5 catch blocks in ModelsCard.js (fetch, setAlias, deleteAlias,
addCustomModel, deleteCustomModel) used console.log only, making
failures invisible to users.

Fix:
- Import useNotificationStore from @/store/notificationStore
- Replace console.log with notify.error() in all 5 catch blocks
- Add notify.success() on successful operations for positive feedback
- Handle non-ok HTTP responses with error messages from API
- Use console.error (not console.log) for dev console logging

Regression test: 5 vitest assertions verify import, hook usage,
notify.error presence (>=5), no silent console.log catches, and
user-friendly error messages. Anti-false-positive mutation verified
(reverting one catch to console.log breaks the test).

Commit on branch gap-p2-29/t_264fbea3.

